            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Nikola Tesla</strong><br>\nNikola Tesla was born on July 10, 1856, in Smiljan, which was then part of the Austrian Empire. His family was Serbian, and his father was an Orthodox priest. Tesla was an exceptional student with a keen memory and a passion for mathematics and science. From an early age, he was fascinated by engines and mechanical work, which laid the foundation for his later inventions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and First Inventions</strong><br>\nTesla attended the Technical University at Graz, Austria, and the University of Prague. At Graz, he first saw the Gramme dynamo, which could operate as a generator or motor. He conceived a way to use alternating current (AC) to drive it, which would become his most famous work. While in school, he studied the uses of AC and began to imagine the possibilities of an AC motor.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Move to the United States</strong><br>\nIn 1884, Tesla moved to the United States with little more than a letter of introduction to famed inventor Thomas Edison. Edison's work with direct current (DC) contrasted with Tesla's vision of an AC-powered future. The two worked together briefly, but Tesla's ideas were too far removed from Edison's DC-focused work, leading to Tesla striking out on his own.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
